### ============================================
### PAYMENTS - Alle endpoints
### ============================================
### Deze file bevat alle endpoints voor betalingen.
### Zorg dat je eerst ingelogd bent (auth.rest) om een token te hebben.
### ============================================

### VARIABELEN
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5082
@contentType = application/json

### TOKEN - Vul dit in na login (kopieer uit auth.rest response)
@token = YOUR_TOKEN_HIER
@adminToken = YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HIER

### ============================================
### GET ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### 1. GET BY ID - Haal specifieke betaling op
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Payments/1
Authorization: Bearer yJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..dcjfRdlo3cFqcHrZUFC7Aw3hlDp9L45EBHPXnu2vh5E
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 2. GET STATUS - Haal betalingsstatus op
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Payments/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 3. GET USER PAYMENTS - Haal alle betalingen van gebruiker op
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Payments/user
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 4. GET USER PAYMENTS - Specifieke gebruiker (Admin kan andere gebruiker opvragen)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Payments/user?userId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 5. GET HISTORY - Haal betalingsgeschiedenis op
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Payments/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 6. GET TOTAL - Haal totaalbedrag van gebruiker op
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Payments/total
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 7. GET ADMIN TOTAL - Haal totaalbedrag op (Admin Only, optioneel userId)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Payments/admin/total
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 8. GET ADMIN TOTAL - Voor specifieke gebruiker
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Payments/admin/total?userId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ============================================
### POST ENDPOINTS - CREATE
### ============================================

### 9. CREATE PAYMENT - Maak nieuwe betaling aan
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Payments
Authorization: Bearer 
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "parkingLotId": 1,
  "licensePlate": "AB-12-CD",
  "duration": 120
}

### 10. CREATE PAYMENT - Betaling voor 2 uur parkeren
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "parkingLotId": 1,
  "licensePlate": "XY-99-ZZ",
  "duration": 120
}

### 11. CREATE PAYMENT - Betaling voor 30 minuten
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "parkingLotId": 1,
  "licensePlate": "AB-12-CD",
  "duration": 30
}

### ============================================
### PATCH ENDPOINTS - UPDATE
### ============================================

### 12. UPDATE STATUS - Update betalingsstatus (Admin kan alle betalingen updaten)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/Payments/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "newStatus": "Paid"
}

### 13. UPDATE STATUS - Markeer als gefaald
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/Payments/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "newStatus": "Failed"
}

### ============================================
### POST ENDPOINTS - REFUND (Admin Only)
### ============================================

### 14. REFUND PAYMENT - Terugbetaling verwerken (Admin Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Payments/1/refund
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

